.Dd September 27, 2026
.Dt VIOSND 4
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm viosnd
.Nd VirtIO sound device
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Cd "viosnd* at virtio?"
.Cd "audio* at viosnd?"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
driver provides an
.Xr audio 4
device for the VirtIO sound device of hypervisors such as QEMU.
.Pp
It plays through the first output stream and records from the first
input stream the device reports, in signed 16 or 32 bit linear samples,
mono or stereo, at the rates the device offers.
Samples are passed in messages of one block each.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr audio 4 ,
.Xr virtio 4
.Rs
.%T Virtual I/O Device (VIRTIO) Version 1.3
.%Q OASIS
.%D October 2023
.Re
.Sh HISTORY
The
.Nm
driver first appeared in
.Nx 12.0 .
.Sh CAVEATS
Jacks, channel maps and the device's control elements are not used, and
there is no mixer.
